'''Futenyan''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and can be obtained by beating any stage in [[Y! Mobile Collaboration Event#Futenyan Appears|Futenyan Appears]] during the [[Y! Mobile Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 281
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Futenyan
|name2 = Massaging Futenyan
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Massaging Futenyan''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has pretty much no use at all, regardless of where in the game you're on. On early game, its stats are very poor, its upgrade cost is too high to improve his usage and there are always better picks for his role such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]], and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]]. In later game, his pathetic range makes him nothing but simply a meatshield, which due to his speed and cost gets easily outclassed by other more common meatshields, such as [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], and their [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Counterparts]].

At least it can help to get some [[User Rank]], if you don't have any cheaper (In terms of upgrade cost) or better unit to upgrade, that is. Even with Strong against Red, Futenyan manages to have so low stats that there's no point in investing in it; at level 30, it can barely manage fighting a [[Pigge]].

